{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01217",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 5.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "welcome make yourself comfortable did you take the bus in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.15,
      "end_seconds": 10.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I drove. The roads were quiet today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.99,
      "end_seconds": 14.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "What do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.29,
      "end_seconds": 22.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "I mean, I'm here because of a red hot swelling on my leg."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.62,
      "end_seconds": 25.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.84,
      "end_seconds": 36.64,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "Glibenclamide, 5 milligrams, before breakfast i do miss it now and then, to be fair"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.6,
      "end_seconds": 41.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Alright, how many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.65,
      "end_seconds": 46.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "For two months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.37,
      "end_seconds": 57.27,
      "duration_seconds": 9.9,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.39,
      "end_seconds": 62.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "it's a couple of times a week. Mild, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.85,
      "end_seconds": 66.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.97,
      "end_seconds": 80.5,
      "duration_seconds": 12.53,
      "text": "It usually comes with dark blisters. I've also had a high fever, for ten days. With high fever, I'd say every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.92,
      "end_seconds": 84.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "have you noticed insect bite or cut?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.62,
      "end_seconds": 89.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "no insect bite or cut, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.57,
      "end_seconds": 92.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "sure. Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.65,
      "end_seconds": 95.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.93,
      "end_seconds": 99.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.75,
      "end_seconds": 102.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.31,
      "end_seconds": 106.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.37,
      "end_seconds": 114.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Yes, I had a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.13,
      "end_seconds": 116.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.46,
      "end_seconds": 122.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.26,
      "end_seconds": 125.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.72,
      "end_seconds": 130.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.16,
      "end_seconds": 144.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.6,
      "end_seconds": 148.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Erm, my sister had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.95,
      "end_seconds": 153.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "so, has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.35,
      "end_seconds": 156.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "I've had diabetes, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.03,
      "end_seconds": 159.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.94,
      "end_seconds": 177.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.05,
      "end_seconds": 181.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.27,
      "end_seconds": 186.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "let me quickly check your readings"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.28,
      "end_seconds": 196.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.6,
      "end_seconds": 224.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 96 percent, heart rate 105, BP is 126 over 72, respiratory rate 22."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.68,
      "end_seconds": 228.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.38,
      "end_seconds": 231.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.53,
      "end_seconds": 247.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.77,
      "text": "the skin on your leg is dusky with blisters and is very tender, and you are feverish"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.28,
      "end_seconds": 269.24,
      "duration_seconds": 16.96,
      "text": "Please sit back down. So, based on the history and the examination, I don't have a clear answer today: a severe deep skin infection needing urgent surgery review is possible, and so is severe cellulitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.94,
      "end_seconds": 277.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.88,
      "end_seconds": 291.52,
      "duration_seconds": 12.64,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a severe deep skin infection needing urgent surgery review, and we'll know more once the an urgent surgical review is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.51,
      "end_seconds": 331.51,
      "duration_seconds": 22.0,
      "text": "I'm going to order an urgent surgical review, for possible necrotising infection. Let's book urgent blood tests to look into severe skin infection. I am sending you to hospital now, do not wait. Don't skip meals, and try to to eat smaller portions more often through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.05,
      "end_seconds": 339.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "Right, right. Please come and see me straight away. So, have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.83,
      "end_seconds": 344.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}